your ability in the first phase can be determinant in the final combat.<br><br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br>- Two game styles in one.<br>- Autosave (save points) and load games.<br>- Steam cloud.<br>- Steam overlay.<br>- List of scores (local).<br>- Achievements (Steam and local).<br><br><br><strong>NOTES:</strong><br>- The game requires the <strong>&quot;Microsoft Visual C++ 2015-2022 redistributable x64&quot;</strong> package for the correct functioning of the Steam features linked to the game. It will give an error when running the game if this package is not installed. <strong>Steam will install this package the first time you run the game.</strong><br>- The game is designed to be used with mouse or touch. For the first stage of the game it is also possible to use some keyboard keys.",
